          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Anthropic's Mythos AI finds hundreds of high-severity security bugs in Firefox, reshaping Mozilla's cybersecurity approach",
            "articleSection": "Daily Utility",
            "abstract": "Mozilla security researchers report that Anthropic's Mythos AI model has uncovered a large number of high-severity vulnerabilities in the Firefox browser codebase, significantly outpacing traditional manual and automated auditing methods. The discovery has prompted Mozilla to restructure its internal security workflow around AI-assisted bug detection. The development signals a broader shift in how open-source projects may use frontier AI models to harden widely-used software.",
            "url": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/05/07/how-anthropics-mythos-has-rewritten-firefoxs-approach-to-cybersecurity/",
            "publisher": {
